        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">$8,427,833 of tax gross-ups related to CIAC was reclassified from Account 252 to Account 254 in Q2 2025. As a result, $1,988,685 reported in Miscellaneous Amortization (Account 425) represents the year-to-date tax gross-up amortization.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
